<span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 零空间的算子——它保证第二项的任何运动都不会破坏已满足的主任务。这套&quot;任务优先级 / 零空间投影&quot;是机器人学与全身 IK 的标准框架，代价是每帧要算雅可比与伪逆，比几何法贵，因此游戏里多用于必须严格分层的全身场景。当雅可比接近奇异时伪逆爆炸，实践中用阻尼最小二乘（DLS）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>J</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><msup><mi>J</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J^T(JJ^T + \\lambda^2 I)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 替代裸伪逆，牺牲一点精度换数值稳定。</p>\n<p>三种调停策略对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加权融合</td>\n<td>无硬保证，折中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>目标不严格冲突、多 look-at</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严格优先级（零空间）</td>\n<td>高优先精确满足</td>\n<td>高（雅可比+伪逆）</td>\n<td>全身 IK、脚必须贴地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层求解顺序</td>\n<td>按顺序覆盖</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>引擎约束栈（先脚后手后头）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引擎里的实用近似-约束栈\">引擎里的实用近似：约束栈</h2><p>学院派的零空间投影很优雅，但多数游戏引擎用一个更朴素、更可控的近似：<strong>约束栈（constraint stack）</strong>——把约束按优先级排成一列，从低到高依次求解，后求解的覆盖先求解的结果。Unity Animation Rigging 与 Unreal Control Rig 的节点图本质就是这种有序求解：你把脚 IK 放在栈底先解、手 IK 其次、look-at 放栈顶最后解，高优先的因为&quot;最后动&quot;而事实上主导了最终姿态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[FK 基础姿态] --&gt; B[解脚 IK&lt;br/&gt;优先级最高 先入栈底]&#10;    B --&gt; C[解手 IK&lt;br/&gt;在当前姿态上求解]&#10;    C --&gt; D[解脊椎弯曲]&#10;    D --&gt; E[解 look-at&lt;br/&gt;最后叠加 事实主导朝向]&#10;    E --&gt; F{有约束被严重破坏?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[降低低优先权重&lt;br/&gt;或回退该约束]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[输出最终姿态]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[FK 基础姿态] --&gt; B[解脚 IK&lt;br/&gt;优先级最高 先入栈底]\n    B --&gt; C[解手 IK&lt;br/&gt;在当前姿态上求解]\n    C --&gt; D[解脊椎弯曲]\n    D --&gt; E[解 look-at&lt;br/&gt;最后叠加 事实主导朝向]\n    E --&gt; F{有约束被严重破坏?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[降低低优先权重&lt;br/&gt;或回退该约束]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[输出最终姿态]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>这套顺序求解不保证全局最优，但<strong>直观、可调、性能可控</strong>，是工程首选。它的关键决策是排序：一般&quot;接触世界的约束优先级最高&quot;（脚贴地 &gt; 手够物 &gt; 视线），因为接触穿帮最刺眼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时才真正需要多目标框架\">何时才真正需要多目标框架</h2><p>务实地说，大量游戏根本不需要严格的多目标优先级——两条腿脚部 IK 各自独立求解、互不干扰就够了。真正需要这套机制的是：攀爬、多点接触的交互（双手扶栏、坐进不规则座椅）、以及追求整体协调的高保真角色（Unreal PBIK Full Body IK 正是为此，见 <a href=\"https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/unreal-engine/control-rig-full-body-ik-in-unreal-engine\">UE FBIK 文档</a>）。判断准则：如果各末端的链不共享关节、不互相影响，独立求解即可，别引入昂贵的全身框架；只有当末端共享骨骼且会打架时，才升级到加权或优先级。落地时它还要与动画混合、按距离降级，见<a href=\"../practice/ik-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多末端 IK 里冗余自由度从福利变稀缺资源，约束需求超过可用自由度时系统过约束，只能取舍。</li>\n<li>冲突分直接（同骨反向拽）与间接（满足 A 移动了 B 的链根）两类。</li>\n<li>加权融合最简单廉价但无硬保证；严格优先级用雅可比零空间投影让高优先任务精确满足、低优先在余量里满足。</li>\n<li>工程首选约束栈：按优先级有序求解、后解覆盖先解，直观可调、性能可控，接触世界的约束排最高优先。</li>\n<li>多数场景不需要多目标框架（独立求解各链即可），仅当末端共享骨骼且冲突时才升级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/ik-model\">骨骼链模型</a> 提供本篇的雅可比与零空间基础；<a href=\"pole-vectors\">极向量与朝向</a> 里的&quot;眼看不过去转身体&quot;就是一个小优先级问题。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：全身姿态协调作为程序化动画的一环见 <a href=\"../../game-procedural-animation/foundations/runtime-pose-generation\">50_game-procedural-animation 的运行时姿态生成篇</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多目标与优先级","id":"多目标与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么多末端会打架","id":"为什么多末端会打架"},{"level":2,"text":"加权融合：最简单的调停","id":"加权融合-最简单的调停"},{"level":2,"text":"严格优先级与雅可比零空间","id":"严格优先级与雅可比零空间"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎里的实用近似：约束栈","id":"引擎里的实用近似-约束栈"},{"level":2,"text":"何时才真正需要多目标框架","id":"何时才真正需要多目标框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"极向量与朝向","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-inverse-kinematics/constraints/pole-vectors"},"next":{"title":"脚部贴地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-inverse-kinematics/practice/foot-placement"}}